    "type": "game",
    "name": "Fallen Vestige",
    "steam_appid": 3517090,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SAVE THE HUMAN RACE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seeking vengeance against the creatures that killed his family, embark on a journey to find the source and uncover the mystery of the creatures in this open-world light RPG with horror elements.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE AN OPEN-WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture through a post-apocalyptic earth from your homestead and uncover unearthly threats where danger lurks in every corner. Explore enemy encampments and abandoned points of interest such as caves and bunkers to find ways to access the source of the creatures.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DISCOVER A COMPELLING STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the story behind the downfall of earth, piece together clues scattered throughout the world to uncover the truth behind the monsters. Why are they here?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT TO SURVIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against terrifying threats, hostile entities that lurk in the dark and prowl the desolate world whilst avoiding environmental hazards. Armed with axes, hammers, knives, rifles, stealth takedowns, and throwables such as grenades and more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY HOW YOU WANT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you want to play with guidance or want to uncover the story yourself, with an intuitive objective system that can be enabled or disabled, you choose how to play the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PARKOUR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scale infrastructure utilising means like vaulting, climbing, and jumping to reach areas otherwise inaccessible.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PUZZLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles using clues found in the vicinity to crack safes and unlock access to new areas.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SKILL TREE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain XP through eliminating enemies and exploring locations to provide permanent benefits to your character, furthering strength, speed, stealth, and health.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SCAVENGE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot powerful equipment to improve your arsenal that will aid you in your journey from abandoned structures teething with threats.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DYNAMIC WEATHER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in photogenic environments that features a real-time light-cycle and a weather system that features rain and snow.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SAVE THE HUMAN RACE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seeking vengeance against the creatures that killed his family, embark on a journey to find the source and uncover the mystery of the creatures in this open-world light RPG with horror elements.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE AN OPEN-WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture through a post-apocalyptic earth from your homestead and uncover unearthly threats where danger lurks in every corner. Explore enemy encampments and abandoned points of interest such as caves and bunkers to find ways to access the source of the creatures.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DISCOVER A COMPELLING STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the story behind the downfall of earth, piece together clues scattered throughout the world to uncover the truth behind the monsters. Why are they here?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT TO SURVIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against terrifying threats, hostile entities that lurk in the dark and prowl the desolate world whilst avoiding environmental hazards. Armed with axes, hammers, knives, rifles, stealth takedowns, and throwables such as grenades and more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY HOW YOU WANT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you want to play with guidance or want to uncover the story yourself, with an intuitive objective system that can be enabled or disabled, you choose how to play the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PARKOUR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scale infrastructure utilising means like vaulting, climbing, and jumping to reach areas otherwise inaccessible.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PUZZLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles using clues found in the vicinity to crack safes and unlock access to new areas.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SKILL TREE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain XP through eliminating enemies and exploring locations to provide permanent benefits to your character, furthering strength, speed, stealth, and health.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SCAVENGE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot powerful equipment to improve your arsenal that will aid you in your journey from abandoned structures teething with threats.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DYNAMIC WEATHER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in photogenic environments that features a real-time light-cycle and a weather system that features rain and snow.</p>",
    "short_description": "Seeking vengeance against the creatures that killed his family, embark on a journey to find the source and uncover the mystery of the creatures in this open-world light RPG with horror elements. Explore, scavenge, fight, and survive through means such as parkour, puzzle solving, and skills.",
